  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (k-(1)/(k))(k²+(1)/(k²))(k⁴+(1)/(k⁴))(k⁸+(1)/(k⁸))(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n (a - b)(a + b) = a2 - b2\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n (k-(1)/(k))(k²+(1)/(k²))(k⁴+(1)/(k⁴))(k⁸+(1)/(k⁸))(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)\n\nDivide and multiply by k+(1)/(k)\n\n( (k-frac{1)/(k))(k+(1)/(k))(k²+(1)/(k²))(k⁴+(1)/(k⁴))(k⁸+(1)/(k⁸))(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)}{k+(1)/(k)}\n\nUsing (a - b)(a + b) = a2 - b2\n\n((k²-frac{1)/(k²))(k²+(1)/(k²))(k⁴+(1)/(k⁴))(k⁸+(1)/(k⁸))(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)}{k + (1)/(k)}\n\n((k⁴-frac{1)/(k⁴))(k⁴+(1)/(k⁴))(k⁸+(1)/(k⁸))(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)}{k + (1)/(k)}\n\n((k⁸-frac{1)/(k⁸))(k⁸+(1)/(k⁸))(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)}{k + (1)/(k)}\n\nfrac{(k¹⁶-(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)(k¹⁶+(1)/(k¹⁶⁾)}{k + (1)/(k)}\n\n frac{k³²-(1)/(k³²⁾}{k+(1)/(k)}\n\n**∴ Option (4) is the correct answer.**",
